  - id: sermon_on_the_plain
    displayName: The Sermon on the Plain
    flavorText: Standing on level ground, Jesus pairs blessings for the poor and
      hungry with woes for the rich and full, then teaches love of enemies and closes
      with the parable of the two builders.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Jesus's core ethical teaching to his disciples and a great multitude,
      delivered standing 'in the plain' rather than on a mountain -- the Beatitudes
      paired with corresponding Woes, teaching on loving enemies and not judging
      others, and the closing parable of the two builders.
    deliveredByManagerId: jesus_luke
    managerId: sermon_on_the_plain
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 38922.6391530333
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
