  - id: commissioning_of_seventy
    displayName: The Commissioning of the Seventy
    flavorText: Jesus appoints seventy disciples and sends them two by two ahead
      of him, and they return rejoicing that even the devils are subject to them.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Jesus appoints and sends out a wider group of disciples beyond the twelve,
      two by two, into every city he intended to visit -- instructing them on dependence
      and urgency, and rejoicing when they return with reports of power over devils.
    deliveredByManagerId: jesus_luke
    managerId: commissioning_of_seventy
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 63298.09639338052
